{"ticker":"MTB","updated":"2026-10-30T23:00:18Z","profile":{"longName":"M&T Bank Corporation","shortName":"M&T Bank Corporation","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Banks - Regional","country":"United States","website":"https://www.mtb.com","fullTimeEmployees":21562,"marketCap":31719229440,"trailingPE":11.531871,"forwardPE":10.4672165,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.3515668,"pegRatio":1.33,"targetMeanPrice":245.92857,"targetHighPrice":294.0,"targetLowPrice":198.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":21,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.005,"earningsGrowth":0.046,"grossMargins":0.0,"operatingMargins":0.43065,"profitMargins":0.31868,"totalRevenue":9464000512,"beta":0.615,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":255.95,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":179.75,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.68},"summary":"M&T Bank Corporation operates as a bank holding company for Manufacturers and Traders Trust Company and Wilmington Trust, National Association that provides retail and commercial banking products and services in the United States. The company operates through three segments: Commercial Bank, Retail Bank, and Institutional Services and Wealth Management. It offers a range of credit products and banking services, such as commercial lending and leasing, letters of credits, deposit products, cash management services, commercial real estate loans, and credit facilities secured by various commercial real estate properties to middle-market and large commercial customers. The company also provides customers deposit products, including demand, savings and time accounts, and other services; automobile and recreational finance loans, home equity loans and lines of credit, credit cards, and other loan products, as well as residential mortgage and real estate loans; business loans, cash management, payroll, direct deposit, and merchant credit card services to consumers and small businesses through branch network, telephone banking, internet banking, and automated teller machines. In addition, it offers trustee, agency, investment management, and administrative services; personal trust, planning and advisory, fiduciary, asset management, family office, and other services; and investment prod","summary_zh":"M&T Bank Corporation 是製造商和貿易商信託公司以及威爾明頓信託全國協會的銀行控股公司，在美國提供零售和商業銀行產品和服務。該公司透過三個部門運作：商業銀行部門、零售銀行部門以及機構服務和財富管理部門。它向中型市場和大型商業客戶提供一系列信貸產品和銀行服務，例如商業貸款和租賃、信用證、存款產品、現金管理服務、商業房地產貸款以及以各種商業房地產擔保的信貸便利。本公司也為客戶提供存款產品，包括活期帳戶、儲蓄帳戶和定期帳戶等服務；汽車和娛樂金融貸款、房屋淨值貸款和信用額度、信用卡和其他貸款產品，以及住宅抵押貸款和房地產貸款；透過分行網路、電話銀行、網路銀行和自動櫃員機向消費者和小型企業提供商業貸款、現金管理薪資、直接存款和商業信用卡服務。此外，它還提供受託人、代理、投資管理和行政服務；個人信託、規劃諮詢、信託、資產管理、家族辦公室等服務；和投資產品","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"銀行 - 區域","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":197.94,"h":198.98,"l":195.61,"c":198.98,"v":1044100},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":199.06,"h":200.83,"l":197.25,"c":198.57,"v":954200},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":199.97,"h":202.83,"l":198.74,"c":202.36,"v":916600},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":202.8,"h":203.96,"l":198.92,"c":199.57,"v":977400},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":199.35,"h":199.66,"l":196.35,"c":199.22,"v":700100},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":199.18,"h":201.63,"l":199.15,"c":199.8,"v":628800},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":200.65,"h":200.82,"l":197.42,"c":198.17,"v":927300},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":197.98,"h":198.92,"l":196.01,"c":197.83,"v":904900},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":198.1,"h":199.84,"l":197.01,"c":198.8,"v":696800},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":198.84,"h":199.69,"l":196.22,"c":196.57,"v":782300},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":196.96,"h":196.96,"l":192.67,"c":195.28,"v":805700},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":195.84,"h":201.11,"l":195.19,"c":198.6,"v":1020100},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":198.41,"h":200.99,"l":197.74,"c":200.43,"v":984500},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":200.17,"h":202.57,"l":198.88,"c":202.02,"v":3604900},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":200.59,"h":201.82,"l":198.14,"c":198.9,"v":1012500},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":199.36,"h":203.0,"l":197.21,"c":200.63,"v":1509900},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":200.47,"h":202.35,"l":198.53,"c":199.44,"v":847000},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":199.2,"h":199.97,"l":197.89,"c":198.79,"v